  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>1️⃣ About our brand and products:</strong><br>New Concept Premium Wax is a professional hair removal brand that offers high-performance waxes for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Our signature heart-shaped wax is designed for maximum elasticity and flawless hair removal, ensuring efficient and comfortable depilation. We provide estheticians with premium products that elevate the client experience.</p><hr><p><strong>2️⃣ What makes us different:</strong><br>Our waxes are formulated for <strong>all skin types</strong>, especially sensitive skin, with superior elasticity that prevents breakage. Unlike regular waxes, our products deliver <strong>consistent results</strong>, are easy to use, and enhance the professional quality of services. We also provide <strong>ongoing support and guidance</strong> for estheticians to grow their business.</p><hr><p><strong>3️⃣ How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn <strong>10% commission on each sale</strong> made through their unique referral link or personalized coupon. Commissions are tracked automatically and paid <strong>monthly via PayPal</strong>. Every purchase made using the affiliate’s link or coupon is credited to them, ensuring fair and transparent earnings.</p><p>To encourage sales, customers using the affiliate link or coupon also receive a 10% discount.</p><hr><p><strong>4️⃣ How to promote us:</strong><br>Affiliates can promote our products through <strong>social media, email marketing, blogs, and websites</strong>. We provide <strong>banners, product photos, videos, and marketing guidelines</strong> to help affiliates effectively showcase our premium waxes. Sharing personal experiences, tutorials, and before/after results is highly encouraged.</p><hr><p><strong>5️⃣ Other information:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Commission applies only to confirmed sales.</p></li><li><p>No commission on canceled, returned, or refunded orders.</p></li><li><p>Fraudulent or unethical behavior results in immediate removal from the program.</p></li><li><p>Affiliates are responsible for following our brand guidelines and not misrepresenting our products.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
